Short:    Dynamic BaudShow for PMBS
Uploader: christian@authmann.de (Christian Authmann)
Author:   christian@authmann.de
Type:     comm/bbs


This program shows the BaudRate of the user currently logged in.

Features:

 - screen-filling ANSI-gfx
 - dynamically generates the letters, no predefined ANSIs!
 - displays all BaudRates from 0 to 999999 baud :-)
 - only 3.324 Bytes


Installation:
  DosDoor: BaudShow $PO



This program is mailware. If you use it you have to send me an email.


